"   ╭ KEYS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮  "
"   │ Playback                    General                                 Playlist                                    │  "
"   │   Space  Play / pause                   /  Find                                          a  Queue               │  "
"   │       n  Next track                     H  History                                       A  Play next           │  "
"   │       p  Previous track                 ,  Settings                                      x  Remove from queue   │  "
"   │       h  Seek back 10s                  L  Library folder                          Shift+↑  Move up in queue    │  "
"   │       l  Seek forward 10s               u  Add server                              Shift+↓  Move down in queue  │  "
"   │       ←  Seek back 5s                   c  Servers                                       o  Cycle sort          │  "
"   │       →  Seek forward 5s                t  Reconnect (in Servers)                        v  Cycle view          │  "
"   │ Shift+←  Seek back 30s         ? / Ctrl+K  Toggle this help                              f  Favorite            │  "
"   │ Shift+→  Seek forward 30s               q  Quit                                          d  Delete (asks first) │  "
"   │   + / =  Volume up          Navigation                                                   S  Save playlist       │  "
"   │   - / _  Volume down                j / ↓  Down                                          R  Rescan              │  "
"   │       s  Toggle shuffle             k / ↑  Up                                            i  Track info          │  "
"   │       r  Cycle repeat           gg / Home  Top                      Text editing                                │  "
"   │       z  Sleep timer              G / End  Bottom                   Ctrl+U / Cmd+Backspace  Clear the field     │  "
"   │       b  A-B repeat         PgDn / Ctrl+D  Page down                Ctrl+W / Alt+Backspace  Delete a word       │  "
"   │       [  Speed down         PgUp / Ctrl+U  Page up                                                              │  "
"   │       ]  Speed up                   Enter  Play selected                                                        │  "
"   │  Ctrl+J  Jump to time                                                                                           │  "
"   │     0-9  Seek to N×10%                                                                                          │  "
"   ╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯  "
